// ===================================================== object shapes ========

function swIsObj(v) { return rtIsObj(v) }

// rtIsArr - a MetaJS list, i.e. an object with a numeric `length` that is not a
// Dictionary, a tuple or an instance box - is SHARED with dart,
// lib/runtime-dartswift.metajs. The two copies had ZERO differences (swIsObj and
// dtIsObj are both rtIsObj). php's phIsList is the same discrimination plus a
// {__refcell} rejection, which is a third specification and stays where it is.

